<p class="small">These local checks flag some formatting that stays literal, heading changes, and unfinished writing. They do not verify facts, grammar, permissions, image contents, or web addresses. Select a finding to inspect its exact article passage; nothing changes automatically. Review approval remains your separate choice.</p>
